! THE CHECKS.  One !SYM: S IPT is the only NAME this page prints.
! Forty-six !CHECK rows -- every line that carries binary.  The five
! SLC rows (8, 11, 17, 20, 23) emit no storage and get no !CHECK,
! printed p.99's convention; 46 + 5 = 51.
